---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
lang: en
description: Foreign Immigration Services is a Bureau of Immigration accredited consultancy in the Philippines, providing guidance on visa, extension, residency and corporate mobility matters.
---
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{% include "partials/urgent-banner.njk" %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Philippine Immigration Consultancy</p>
      <h1>Considered guidance on immigration matters in the Philippines.</h1>
      <p class="hero__lede">Foreign Immigration Services is a Bureau of Immigration accredited consultancy, assisting individuals, families and organisations with visa, extension, residency, corporate mobility and related immigration matters in the Philippines.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Send an Enquiry</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/services/">Explore Our Services</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero__accreditation">
        {{ icon("accreditation", 40) }}
        <span><strong>Bureau of Immigration Accredited Consultancy</strong><br>Accreditation No. {{ site.accreditation.number }}</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__visual">
{% include "partials/hero-motif.njk" %}
      <img class="hero__logo" src="/assets/images/fis-logo.png" alt="Foreign Immigration Services" width="612" height="408">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h2>Core Immigration Services</h2>
      <p>Our practice is organised across four core areas of immigration work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("visa-applications", 44) }}
        <h3>Visa &amp; Immigration Applications</h3>
        <p>Planning to enter, work, study or otherwise stay in the Philippines and unsure which visa applies to you?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/visa-and-immigration-applications/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("extensions-compliance", 44) }}
        <h3>Extensions &amp; Compliance</h3>
        <p>Already in the Philippines and need to extend your stay or keep up with reporting requirements?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/extensions-and-compliance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("residency-status", 44) }}
        <h3>Residency &amp; Long-Term Status</h3>
        <p>Considering a longer-term or permanent move to the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/residency-and-long-term-status/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("corporate-mobility", 44) }}
        <h3>Corporate &amp; Global Mobility</h3>
        <p>Relocating employees or managing cross-border staff moving into the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/corporate-and-global-mobility/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--muted">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h2>Specialised Services</h2>
      <p>Focused assistance for specific, often time-sensitive, immigration situations.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--specialised">
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("status-review", 44) }}
        <h3>Immigration Status Review &amp; Regularisation Assistance</h3>
        <p>Uncertain about your immigration status, visa validity, or Bureau of Immigration records?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/immigration-status-review-and-regularisation/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("airport-vip", 44) }}
        <h3>Airport VIP Meet &amp; Assist</h3>
        <p>Want a smoother, personally assisted airport arrival or departure?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/airport-vip-meet-and-assist/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("motions-blacklist", 44) }}
        <h3>Immigration Motions, Blacklist &amp; Derogatory Record Assistance</h3>
        <p>Dealing with a blacklist, watchlist, or other derogatory immigration record?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/immigration-motions-blacklist-and-derogatory-record-assistance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("legal-support", 44) }}
        <h3>Legal Support for Foreign Nationals</h3>
        <p>Facing criminal or immigration proceedings in the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/legal-support-for-foreign-nationals/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("lost-passport", 44) }}
        <h3>Lost Passport &amp; Travel Document Assistance</h3>
        <p>Lost your passport or travel document while in the Philippines?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/lost-passport-and-travel-document-assistance/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("document-verification", 44) }}
        <h3>Visa &amp; Immigration Document Verification</h3>
        <p>Need to verify the authenticity or status of a visa or immigration document?</p>
        <a class="card__link" href="/services/visa-and-immigration-document-verification/">Learn more →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-banner">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Not Sure What You Need?</h2>
    <p>Whether you have lost your passport, are uncertain about your immigration status, need to verify a visa or document, or simply do not know which immigration process applies to your circumstances, tell us what is happening and we can help identify the appropriate next step.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/contact/">Tell Us Your Situation</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feature-split">
  <div class="wrap feature-split__grid">
    <div class="feature-split__content">
      <p class="tag">Featured Service</p>
      <h2>Airport VIP Meet &amp; Assist</h2>
      <p class="feature-split__lede">A smoother airport experience, from arrival to onward transport.</p>
      <p>Our Airport VIP Meet &amp; Assist service provides personalised assistance throughout the airport journey while observing all applicable airline, airport, Immigration, Customs, security and other government procedures.</p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/services/airport-vip-meet-and-assist/">Learn More About Airport VIP Meet &amp; Assist</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-split__visual">
      {{ icon("airport-vip", 140) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__intro">
      <h2>Client Portal</h2>
      <p>A secure Client Portal is being developed in stages. Here is what is available now, and what is coming.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        {{ icon("portal-enquiry", 44) }}
        <p class="tag tag--available">Available now, interim</p>
        <h3>Send an Enquiry</h3>
        <p>Reach us directly by email while the dedicated system is developed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--muted">
        {{ icon("portal-upload", 44) }}
        <p class="tag">Not yet available</p>
        <h3>Document Upload</h3>
        <p>Planned once storage, retention and privacy safeguards are finalised.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--muted">
        {{ icon("portal-track", 44) }}
        <p class="tag">Not yet available</p>
        <h3>Track Your Enquiry / Application</h3>
        <p>Planned alongside our secure client system.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card--notice">
        {{ icon("portal-payments", 44) }}
        <p class="tag">Not yet available</p>
        <h3>Payments</h3>
        <p>Accepted after the scope of services and applicable fees have been confirmed by our team.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-md"><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/client-portal/">Open the Client Portal →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section trust-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="trust-section__inner">
      {{ icon("accreditation", 52) }}
      <div>
        <h2>Bureau of Immigration Accredited Consultancy</h2>
        <p>Accreditation No. {{ site.accreditation.number }}. See our <a href="/accreditation/">Accreditation page</a> for details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
